Let digits be a list of 1, 2, and 3.
Let position be the last position of digits.
Let carry be 1.
Repeat while position is at least 0 and carry is 1.
Let sum be item position of digits plus carry.
Set item position of digits to sum modulo 10.
Set carry to sum divided by 10.
Set position to one less than position.

For each digit in digits, print digit.
